DD60 8540             (    forth6809.asm):01955         INXOVRN:    BITA  #SR_PE
DD62 2703             (    forth6809.asm):01956                     BEQ   INXPE
DD64 7C017E           (    forth6809.asm):01957                     INC   PECOUNT
DD67 3B               (    forth6809.asm):01958         INXPE:      RTI
                      (    forth6809.asm):01959         
