EC7F 0829             (    forth6809.asm):05119         UD16LOOP:   ASL   DIVNUM+1
EC81 0928             (    forth6809.asm):05120                     ROL   DIVNUM
EC83 092D             (    forth6809.asm):05121                     ROL   DIVREM+1
